#: scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be9e70bae9d5f48b28eb5cb719f73ee192588191288a29474d8d0c9bc10dff1f
