"⟪k:0⟫......e⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫......compris ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫.........uez⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫......le⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫............bien..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ed69620ce55dfb48ea7cc0ce4268d0bb6e1be2e38042b04710f864a3e0cfb1e
#. default-sha256: efdc271509727401c5bc5d9e8389d0cb422245d0332056c0022bd29843aa76f0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was having trouble making out what they were saying, but he could tell it was several "
"men, and they were outside the front door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait du mal à comprendre de quoi elles parlaient mais il pouvait dire que c’était "
"plusieurs hommes et qu’ils étaient devant la porte d’entrée."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecb23e7682ce3f1550e2ba7d66f55e6ca7eb0944574b80cbfabc12b7198dd06a
#. default-sha256: 2df2211099a2a04ef7a86f6f615220bbc30f961c438cb350fd992328156833c6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The fact that he could hear them at all through the heavy door meant they were probably "
"shouting quite loudly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Qu’il puisse les entendre à travers la lourde porte signifiait qu’ils devaient crier très "
"fort."

#: scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
