msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8891887af03a9d1d78f334df076331a0becd62616abfb378b71a364485842f25
#. default-sha256: 2a0720016a033eac039bee635b9d9e36bd6759f3f3bf8ee468579e111021607c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An indescribable sense of uneasiness came over him. ⟪k:1⟫Dread. ⟪k:2⟫He drew nearer to the "
"door and focused on the voices on the other side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Une indescriptible sensation de malaise s’empara de lui. ⟪k:1⟫De peur. ⟪k:2⟫Il s’approcha de "
"la porte et se concentra sur les voix de l’autre côté."

#: scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8d24236588016fb7f968e2db172a3684b21cf4f6f32c61383753aa9996d3661
#. default-sha256: 125ea175d30b84bc520684683efd9ecc3e3c4beac7eb67956e9ea7b6d1acc3ac
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They grew clearer—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫enough for him to make out what the men were saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elles gagnèrent en clarté—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ assez pour qu’il comprenne ce que les hommes étaient en "
"train de dire."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6443bd948179ff63b28f35170b21fb67e54508dc1e387e802e26e5c93f695101
#. default-sha256: 608bf40e0c6fa23af53209a841acd712dc04e071492f0d2990867755eb444ad5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s in place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re ready to kill this witch now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tout est en place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫On est prêt à tuer la sorcière."

#: scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c0e24a7cd2d9cd38d347b64754398e25c616a19ec130197da490d8ef841c893
#. default-sha256: 8afe37d744c297162307290e6176173e5ac69c985c10104a3b62a8c46c475d73
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is definitely the place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That half-dead bandit said she was in this mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est sûr, c’est le bon endroit.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ce bandit à moitié mort disait qu’elle était dans "
"ce manoir."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d956fbf26ffb9b706fd1e2f51c18bbc218a162877adb608efb186ce49ee76f1d
#. default-sha256: c51c0acef40917075a967a5669c4f139ef254ad3e70034a4cd32f0d1dc89cf33
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Listen well. No matter what we find in there, we kill it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It could be a child for "
"all I care—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that doesn’t change anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫É⟪k:2⟫coutez bien. Quel que soit ce qu’on y trouve, on le tue.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ce pourrait "
"être un enfant que ça m’est bien égal—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ ça ne change rien."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 751babd13e265016f5a34309186a65a63ac34fa3323b2dbbf55869314c7c5b02
#. default-sha256: d16ef3bf4d8327a624c361da44433f8581a3619e406f345ddd897efa15c12b7c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tuez la sorcière..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d794b7bd2a4443145b94a116173d58cc0a41fa9e29b5e76efdb8c28bc03b584
#. default-sha256: 4ce36a271f31abfc9e79248130c7ac8bfd9d7ea352bd5b55a28800cfe5dac89c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch! Kill the witch! Kill the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tuez la sorcière ! Tuez la sorcière ! Tuez la sorcière !"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d43e6f8e37436b9e21f5883b8ed7321fabc4621ac03395e077f4781eefe3dc
#. default-sha256: f0f04c711f011a8a9874adb15a2c6bd6b568ea1a0eb6f41a83310b961977028e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cacf1c3986498649d51a77ab6854aa4d30b4940e241304a8adb8f0dee7614c97
#. default-sha256: c2c24ee17726016005515b50251a42cf5e5261c5cc44a10a9152935f225a823c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What he heard beyond the door was a group of men shouting for the death of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce qu’il entendit derrière la porte était un groupe d’hommes qui appelaient à tuer la "
"sorcière."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 006e438641dba7ab63a862b8e817aec2a23e7971a704ac847f6ece35f6cb86a2
#. default-sha256: 4a10e272077ce0bbbe575c2f488ef48f43f043a3f3e7312aca66a8608665b9c8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that moment, Michel regretted his decision to let the bandit go free and not watch over "
"him until the moment of his demise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ ce moment-là, Michel regretta sa décision d’avoir laissé filer le bandit et de "
"ne pas l’avoir gardé jusqu’à ce qu’il pousse son dernier souffle."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f59c6cc52f3829656815f2c872a52567a868f4f7797af41af1ed3dc55e00e6a
#. default-sha256: e05234101097385ba59312915ae4d2d26b79bc8b4ac045bbfe19734dd57a5dda
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He must have made his way down to the village in search of help, where he revealed what he "
"had found at the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait dû retourner au village chercher de l’aide et révéler ce faisant ce qu’il avait "
"trouvé au manoir."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8ee452c02b667d6dfa75e4e236e34c2dea781a7a17587e43fd4b93676a9da2a
#. default-sha256: 8487586e68163ac19b42c9563675c74495149454252d194babb378cdf12c381d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Dammit!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bon sang !"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7d6e429fb6db9c18ed7d365953d5cb5ccec0d552ff3e4c4f7f4d033ca1f9230
#. default-sha256: ab8c8645880a3a9c71c1b8bae8d796fa3000ce18ae6808abd3a6a53649852d0c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it was too late.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Regret would solve nothing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais il était trop tard.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le regret ne résoudrait rien."

#: scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dec9da8f6cd77331ab1250a2ebef88332f1d9b39858386bb75d3058e1480752d
#. default-sha256: fc75a6d9b2c85a9caf7807d73304995ab2dd9b7544501f91739c649cc16e850d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could neither stop the villagers from raiding the house, nor could he stop the White-"
"Haired Girl from dying to the effects of his curse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ne pouvait empêcher les villageois d’envahir la maison, de même qu’il ne pouvait empêcher "
"la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs de mourir des suites de sa malédiction."

#: scenario4:scenario4_181FDD0D_E253_466B_A870_811424899C19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f87cc3fe8666fd03f418086569034e6ccfe4c20eee0134952043b38a042255c
#. default-sha256: aa4102e702be9cb8610cf445f25084d3e938f82eea7760612db6eaee4e742b93
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_181FDD0D_E253_466B_A870_811424899C19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was helpless to do anything. ⟪k:1⟫The gears of his fate had locked him onto a path of "
"tragedy and were turning mercilessly onward."
msgstr ""
