msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And thus, the mansion was left bereft of a master, to travel slowly through the ages until "
"someone came along to give it life once more."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et ainsi, le manoir fut laissé sans maître, il voyagea lentement à travers les âges jusqu’à "
"ce que quelqu’un vienne pour lui redonner vie."
